    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## fn_add_articles()\n\nAccepts a batch of raw articles from a news source and:\n\n1. **Normalizes** fields using a source-specific mapping\n2. **Filters** out articles missing required fields\n3. **Fetches** the full HTML page for each article\n4. **Extracts** the article body using a CSS selector\n5. **Merges** extracted content back into the article object",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 480
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -272
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4cd9c9fa-74f6-4dae-817e-dfbb77c74ad3",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Input Contract\n\nEach item passed in must have this shape:\n\n```\n{\n  articles: [...],\n  required: ['title', 'link'],\n  mapped: {\n    title: 'title',\n    pubDate: ['pubDate', 'isoDate']\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe `mapped` arrays are priority lists — first existing field wins.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 448
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -688,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "680aaaec-435e-42c9-85b8-e611d7df43ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Article Extraction\n\nFor each article:\n\n1. Fetch the full HTML page (`link`)\n2. Skip if fetch fails (HTTP error filtered out)\n3. Extract body text using `selector` (CSS)\n4. Merge extracted `article` text back into the article object",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 464
      },
